    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;typename T&gt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_log_Argument_2cabba.html\">Argument</a>&lt; T &gt; Arg (T &amp;&amp;arg, const char *name=nullptr, const char *unit=nullptr, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_log_Format_2a1754.html\">Format</a> format=<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_log_ara_log_10815c.html#SWS_LOG_00208\">Dflt</a>()) noexcept;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Create a wrapper object for the given arguments. Calling this function shall be ill-formed if any of these conditions are met: • T is not an arithmetic type and not \"bool\" and not convertible to \"<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_StringView_cfeb8f.html\">ara::core::StringView</a>\" and not convertible to \"<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Span_f16d72.html\">ara::core::Span</a>&lt;const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_core_ara_core_e30e31.html#SWS_CORE_04200\">ara::core::Byte</a>&gt;\" • T is convertible to \"<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_StringView_cfeb8f.html\">ara::core::StringView</a>\" or convertible to \"<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Span_f16d72.html\">ara::core::Span</a>&lt;const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_core_ara_core_e30e31.html#SWS_CORE_04200\">ara::core::Byte</a>&gt;\" or \"bool\", and \"unit\" is not \"nullptr\"</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
